            if(action=="refresh"){await RefreshDirectBoard(ct);directPage=0;}else if(action=="area"){if(index<0||index>2)throw new Exception("招募地区无效");directArea=index;directPage=0;}else if(action=="category"){if(index<0||index>16)throw new Exception("招募分类无效");directCategory=index;directPage=0;}else if(action=="next")directPage++;else if(action=="previous")directPage--;else if(action=="read"){if(Environment.TickCount64-directLastRequest>=15000)await RefreshDirectBoard(ct);}else throw new Exception("未知招募操作");return await OnGame(ReadDirectBoard);
        }finally{recruitmentLock.Release();}
    }
